# ── Venvy runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Created in the directory Venvy is launched from (or VENVY_DATA_DIR).
#
# `.venvy_key` decrypts the secrets held in data.db. Keep it out of git, and
# back it up *alongside* the database — either one alone is useless.
data.db
data.db-shm
data.db-wal
data.db.bak.*
.venvy_key
apps/
backups/
.runtime/
*.db
*.sqlite3

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

